  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid to Yemen HF for 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to the Yemen Humanitarian Fund for 2025. The Yemen Humanitarian Funds has various projects which focus on gender equality, nutrition and inclusion of persons with disabilities. In May 2025 an addendum was made to HNRP, it has 3 main objectives. 1: decrease crisis-related morbidity and mortality through targeted life-saving assistance, ensuring safety, equity and inclusivity. 2: improve and maintain non-discriminatory access to basic services. 3: improve the protection and dignity of the most vulnerable crisis-affected population, by ensuring timely, principled, and non-discriminatory humanitarian assistance and solutions by promoting international norms and standards.</narrative>
  </description>
